WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:13.984
Danny: Okay. We need to get to work.

2
00:00:13.985 --> 00:00:21.236
Bello: School!

3
00:00:21.237 --> 00:00:23.768
Tina: He’s going to get us in trouble.

4
00:00:23.769 --> 00:00:26.355
Brad: We need to do something with him.

5
00:00:26.356 --> 00:00:28.168
Bello: Boo!

6
00:00:28.169 --> 00:00:35.695
Danny: Okay, Bello. Just go over there and play in the corner.

7
00:00:35.696 --> 00:00:38.530
Brad: And what is he supposed to play with?

8
00:00:38.531 --> 00:00:40.887
Danny: Uh, I don’t know.

9
00:00:40.888 --> 00:00:42.415
Tina: I’ve got an idea.

10
00:00:42.416 --> 00:00:44.379
I’ll be right back!

11
00:00:44.380 --> 00:00:47.898
Danny: Don’t get caught!

12
00:00:47.899 --> 00:00:51.971
Brad: We should put paper over the windows and the door.

13
00:00:51.972 --> 00:00:57.118
Danny: That’s right. Or somebody will see Bello.

14
00:00:57.119 --> 00:01:01.004
Brad: This might take us awhile.

15
00:01:01.005 --> 00:01:02.842
Danny: Oh no, it won’t.

16
00:01:02.843 --> 00:01:08.766
Bello, come here.

17
00:01:08.767 --> 00:01:12.195
Hold the paper like this.

18
00:01:12.196 --> 00:01:17.543
Danny: See? It’s pretty good having a giant around!

19
00:01:17.544 --> 00:01:23.148
Brad: Wow, that was quick.

20
00:01:23.149 --> 00:01:25.789
Tina: This is the best I could do!

21
00:01:25.790 --> 00:01:27.866
Danny: It’s worth a try.

22
00:01:27.867 --> 00:01:29.547
Tina: Here you go, Bello.

23
00:01:29.548 --> 00:01:37.279
What do you think?

24
00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:41.561
Bello: Ball.

25
00:01:41.562 --> 00:01:43.464
Tina: I think he likes it!

26
00:01:43.465 --> 00:01:45.682
Danny: Good job, Tina!

27
00:01:45.683 --> 00:01:49.029
Brad: Okay. Let’s figure out what to do.

28
00:01:49.030 --> 00:01:53.301
Danny: There’s going to be a problem when we get back to Ginormous.

29
00:01:53.302 --> 00:01:54.759
Tina: Tristay?

30
00:01:54.760 --> 00:01:56.994
Brad: He’s definitely a problem.

31
00:01:56.995 --> 00:02:00.557
Danny: I was thinking about his evil helpers.

32
00:02:00.558 --> 00:02:04.491
Brad: Oh yeah. They captured us pretty easily.

33
00:02:04.492 --> 00:02:07.652
Danny: We have to find a way to defeat them.

34
00:02:07.653 --> 00:02:10.849
Tina: Otherwise, we’ll never get to Tristay.

35
00:02:10.850 --> 00:02:15.695
Danny: That’s right. So what’s the best plan of attack?

36
00:02:15.696 --> 00:02:18.218
Tina: They’re big. They’re strong.

37
00:02:18.219 --> 00:02:20.527
They can fly.

38
00:02:20.528 --> 00:02:24.108
Danny: But we have our imaginations.

39
00:02:24.109 --> 00:02:26.261
Brad: Hey, look around.

40
00:02:26.262 --> 00:02:29.550
Where are we?

41
00:02:29.552 --> 00:02:32.456
Tina: We’re in an art classroom.

42
00:02:32.457 --> 00:02:37.667
Brad: That’s right! I’ll bet that Tristay’s evil helpers don’t like art!

43
00:02:37.668 --> 00:02:41.631
Danny: Great idea! We’ll scare them with color!

44
00:02:41.632 --> 00:02:44.182
They won’t know what hit them.

45
00:02:44.183 --> 00:02:46.955
Danny: Tina, you gather some paint.

46
00:02:46.956 --> 00:02:49.622
Brad, get some more modeling clay.

47
00:02:49.623 --> 00:02:52.005
Brad: You bet.

48
00:02:52.006 --> 00:03:00.719
Danny: And me . . . I’ll get some crayons.

49
00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:03.625
Danny: Uh . . . who was that?

50
00:03:03.626 --> 00:03:05.267
Tina: I’m here.

51
00:03:05.268 --> 00:03:09.561
Brad: I’m here.

52
00:03:09.562 --> 00:03:12.821
Danny: Uh-oh.
